Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:05.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your agent is working. So what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:07.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could be running more of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:13.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,In Bento Term, all of your agents run in one window, like a bento box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:17.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,You watch every one of them at once, instead of switching from task to task.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:21.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,When one needs your attention, its color tells you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Talking is about three times faster than typing. So voice is the main way you give input.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:32.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can drive the shell by voice. More importantly, you can direct your agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.95,0:00:39.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bento hears the context, so technical terms, even names from your code, come out right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:42.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your agents don't stop when you leave the desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.55,0:00:45.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,On the sofa, the iPad gives you the whole setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:49.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,On the road, your phone can finish anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.45,0:00:56.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Parallel, voice, remote. It's one way of working. And the gains multiply.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:21.70,Chap,,0,0,0,,A WHOLE TEAM, ONE SCREEN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:39.40,Chap,,0,0,0,,SAY IT, DON'T TYPE IT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:49.40,Chap,,0,0,0,,LEAVE THE DESK, NOT THE WORK
